// facet_runtime/winui - the WinUI opt-in from before WinUI was the default.
//
// WinUI IS the Windows backend now (netdu/cplus#20): `App::run` uses it with
// nothing selected, so `select()` has nothing left to do. It stays so an app
// written against the opt-in still builds; drop the import and the call.
// The deprecated Win32 backend is the opt-out: `facet_runtime/win32`.
fn select() { return; }
